<title>SRI LANKA: Lanka Ceramic says '96 net up 503 pct.</title>
<headline>Lanka Ceramic says '96 net up 503 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Lanka Ceramic Ltd for 12 months ending 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>	   (in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			    1996		    1995</p>
<p>    Turnover	  1,811.28    vs	1,478.61</p>
<p>    Net profit	  238.93    vs	   39.56</p>
<p>    Tax		    45.72    vs	   60.33</p>
<p>NOTE - Lanka Ceramic Ltd makes ceramicware for the local and export market. The company said in a statement it had an extraordinary income of 167.4 million rupees in 1996. It did not give details.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
